      "text": "angels ministered to Jacob2, Jacob 7:5. Sherem confesses power of the Holy Ghost and ministering of angels, Jacob 7:17. Amaleki1 exhorts all men to believe in ministering of angels, Omni 1:25. angels minister unto Nephi3 daily, 3 Ne. 7:18. angels minister to Nephite children, 3 Ne. 17:24. by ministering of angels, men begin to exercise faith in Christ, Moro. 7:25. angels have not ceased to minister unto men, Moro. 7:29. by faith angels appear and minister unto men, Moro. 7:37. to another is given gift of beholding angels and ministering spirits, Moro. 10:14.",
